and use the Suite in the ordinary course of the Licensee's own legal practice.

The license extends to the Licensee's attorneys, employees, and contractors while
acting on the Licensee's behalf.


2. PERMITTED USE

The Licensee may:

  (a) install the Suite in the Licensee's own environments;
  (b) populate the Suite's install-time tokens with the Licensee's own firm
      information, branding, roles, and system names;
  (c) modify reference files and content specifications for the Licensee's own
      internal use;
  (d) use output generated by the Suite in the Licensee's client matters,
      including in documents filed with a court, subject to Section 5.


3. RESTRICTIONS

The Licensee may not:

  (a) redistribute, resell, sublicense, lease, lend, or publish the Suite or any
